WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.448 --> 00:00:01.281
(swishing)

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:04.311
(swinging)

00:00:04.311 --> 00:00:06.010
- I'm a little bit
nervous to see what you're

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:09.155
going to choose 'cus it's
gonna be on my body forever

00:00:09.155 --> 00:00:11.452
but I'm also excited.

00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:14.581
(mellow music)

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.508
I have 17 tattoos now.

00:00:16.508 --> 00:00:17.903
I have a Gandhi quote that says,

00:00:17.903 --> 00:00:19.611
"Live like you will die tomorrow.

00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:21.664
Learn like you will live forever."

00:00:21.664 --> 00:00:24.386
My dad is a veteran so
I wanted to do something

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:25.745
that made me think of him.

00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:28.009
I was thinking for my
next tattoo, I want to get

00:00:28.009 --> 00:00:30.259
something on my lower back.

00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:37.374
I've battled a lot with
eating disorders and crippling

00:00:37.374 --> 00:00:39.271
anxiety and depression

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:41.463
and chronic illness.

00:00:41.463 --> 00:00:44.171
My life isn't perfect but
it's definitely gotten

00:00:44.171 --> 00:00:45.801
to a really good place.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:49.001
And I also, sort of wanna combine
that to commemorate my mom

00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:53.062
why, because she's a huge
part of who I am and who I'm

00:00:53.062 --> 00:00:56.397
becoming and when she passed it was

00:00:56.397 --> 00:00:58.847
a really huge turning point in my life.

00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:01.764
She was able to exhibit such grace

00:01:02.605 --> 00:01:05.562
and even in the most horrific situations.

00:01:05.562 --> 00:01:09.273
She was calm and loving and patient and

00:01:09.273 --> 00:01:10.773
she saw people not

00:01:11.808 --> 00:01:13.475
for just who they were

00:01:13.475 --> 00:01:14.938
but for who they could be.

00:01:14.938 --> 00:01:18.107
She saw the good in everyone
and tried to push them

00:01:18.107 --> 00:01:19.976
to become better.

00:01:19.976 --> 00:01:22.348
Now it's up to you to pick my tattoo

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.851
and a tattoo artist here at Body Electric

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:28.760
is going to design something
and I'm not going to see it

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:32.136
until it's on my body, so
be nice to me. (laughs)

00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:35.636
(upbeat electronic music)

00:01:37.142 --> 00:01:39.392
(swishing)

00:01:43.877 --> 00:01:45.565
- Today I'm tattooing Heather.

00:01:45.565 --> 00:01:48.379
These people from internet
gave me the idea to do it.

00:01:48.379 --> 00:01:51.436
So this idea is basically, it's a big wave

00:01:51.436 --> 00:01:53.149
made it with small waves.

00:01:53.149 --> 00:01:57.541
In life you can break big
problems with small problems

00:01:57.541 --> 00:02:00.024
and then you make everything more easy.

00:02:00.024 --> 00:02:01.232
(swishing)

00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:03.088
(upbeat electronic music)

00:02:03.088 --> 00:02:05.494
- I feel pretty anxious,

00:02:05.494 --> 00:02:07.577
and a little bit on edge,

00:02:08.507 --> 00:02:10.194
but I'm also really excited.

00:02:10.194 --> 00:02:13.584
The best case scenario
is that I will love it

00:02:13.584 --> 00:02:15.100
and it will be beautiful.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.173
The worst case scenario is
that it will be something

00:02:18.173 --> 00:02:21.862
that I don't like and I
might have to invest in some

00:02:21.862 --> 00:02:22.695
laser removal down the road.

00:02:22.695 --> 00:02:24.772
I'm ready to be surprised!

00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:28.272
(upbeat electronic music)

00:02:33.266 --> 00:02:35.516
(drilling)

00:02:37.886 --> 00:02:41.386
(upbeat electronic music)

00:02:50.817 --> 00:02:54.317
(upbeat electronic music)

00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:04.083
(upbeat electronic music)

00:03:14.271 --> 00:03:16.018
- All right, Heather.

00:03:16.018 --> 00:03:16.851
(buzzing)

00:03:16.851 --> 00:03:18.465
It's pretty much done.

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:19.574
- Yay!

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:20.683
- Are you ready to see it?

00:03:20.683 --> 00:03:22.250
- I'm ready.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.417
(booming)

00:03:25.759 --> 00:03:28.035
I feel like I'm gonna be
relieved when I see it.

00:03:28.035 --> 00:03:29.522
- One, two, three.

00:03:29.522 --> 00:03:30.492
(gasps)

00:03:30.492 --> 00:03:32.982
- Oh wow! It's beautiful!

00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:36.017
I love it! I'm really relieved.

00:03:36.017 --> 00:03:37.850
I'm super happy.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.441
I love what it represents
and I really like that

00:03:40.441 --> 00:03:42.959
that's the conclusion
that the internet came to

00:03:42.959 --> 00:03:44.880
given the stories that I told.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.218
Even though your problems
can seem really huge

00:03:48.218 --> 00:03:52.062
in comparison with the big
picture. They're really not.

00:03:52.062 --> 00:03:55.487
I feel like it really represents
where I've been in my life

00:03:55.487 --> 00:03:57.159
and where I am.

00:03:57.159 --> 00:03:58.129
Thank you internet!

00:03:58.129 --> 00:03:58.962
Thank you Jacob!
- Thank you!

00:03:58.962 --> 00:04:00.628
- So much!
- Good job!

00:04:00.628 --> 00:04:01.461
- Yay!

00:04:01.461 --> 00:04:04.961
(upbeat electronic music)

00:04:13.161 --> 00:04:15.411
(swishing)

